WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.126 --> 00:00:00.959
(energetic instrumental music)

00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:02.357
- [Narrator] In Chungju, South Korea,

00:00:02.357 --> 00:00:05.201
there is a family carrying on
a generations-long tradition

00:00:05.201 --> 00:00:08.251
of making yeot, an old school Korean treat

00:00:08.251 --> 00:00:10.584
that is still popular today.

00:00:13.339 --> 00:00:17.089
(speaks in foreign language)

00:00:22.869 --> 00:00:25.077
- [Narrator] Yeot dates
back more than 1,000 years

00:00:25.077 --> 00:00:26.963
to the Goryeo Dynasty.

00:00:26.963 --> 00:00:30.713
(speaks in foreign language)

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:01.340
(playful instrumental music)

00:02:00.107 --> 00:02:03.774
(gentle instrumental music)

00:02:11.815 --> 00:02:15.982
(moves into lively instrumental music)

00:02:21.215 --> 00:02:25.048
(speaks in foreign language)

